WEBVTT

00:26:29.038 --> 00:26:34.802
So, I've worked in many companies
that have gotten into lawsuits, antitrust,

00:26:34.826 --> 00:26:38.191
so people became very careful
about what they put in their email.

00:26:38.215 --> 00:26:41.389
In the companies that I worked in,
American companies,

00:26:41.413 --> 00:26:42.569
we've been told,

00:26:42.593 --> 00:26:44.162
"Don't say anything in an email

00:26:44.186 --> 00:26:46.418
that you don't want
the whole world to see."

00:26:46.442 --> 00:26:51.323
And I think that's a similar behavior,
it's a self-correcting behavior.

00:26:51.347 --> 00:26:54.045
And similarly, we now see, you know,

00:26:54.069 --> 00:26:58.212
Jeff Bezos' text messages,
which were private, are being exposed.

00:26:58.577 --> 00:27:00.577
And we see examples like that,